### створити задачу
POST {{host}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "dimension": 500, "epsilon": 1e-8, "maxIterations": 20000, "seed": 7, "dominance": 1.01 }

### список задач
GET {{host}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### одна задача
GET {{host}}/api/tasks/e056346a-9e00-4221-a2d6-bae65928970b
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### скасувати задачу
POST {{host}}/api/tasks/e056346a-9e00-4221-a2d6-bae65928970b/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### неправильні параметри, буде 400
POST {{host}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "dimension": 100000 }

### без токена, буде 401
GET {{host}}/api/tasks

